      <Ordine>15</Ordine>
      <Capitolo>Automatic transmission oil drain procedure</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;html xmlns:v=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml&quot; xmlns:o=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; xmlns:w=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word&quot; xmlns:m=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40&quot;&gt;     &lt;body lang=IT style=&apos;tab-interval:35.4pt&apos;&gt;  &lt;div class=WordSection1&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Place the vehicle on a level&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Turn off the engine&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Remove the lower soundproofing cover.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Remove, if necessary, the thermal protection plate.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Remove the drain plug &lt;B&gt;A&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Wait for the gearbox oil to drain completely&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt;CAUTION: &lt;/B&gt;Do not start the engine without oil in the gearbox&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Reinsert the drain plug &lt;B&gt;A&lt;/B&gt;, tightening to &lt;B&gt;8 Nm.&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/body&gt;  &lt;/html&gt;</Corpo>
