      <Ordine>16</Ordine>
      <Capitolo>Automatic transmission oil filter replacement</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;html xmlns:v=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml&quot; xmlns:o=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; xmlns:w=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word&quot; xmlns:m=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40&quot;&gt;     &lt;body lang=IT style=&apos;tab-interval:35.4pt&apos;&gt;  &lt;div class=WordSection1&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; The automatic transmission oil filter is located inside the oil pan.&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt;CAUTION: &lt;/B&gt;In this transmission model, the oil filter is built into the oil pan. To proceed with filter replacement, you must replace the oil pan.&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt;CAUTION: &lt;/B&gt;Always replace the oil pan and its screws when the pan is disassembled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/body&gt;  &lt;/html&gt;</Corpo>
      <RifIDFileIMGANI>299007668</RifIDFileIMGANI>
